{"page":187,"blocks":[{"x":0.72017,"y":0.05257,"w":0.23134,"h":0.01535,"fs":0.01535,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"3.7 Implicit Differentiation 173"},{"x":0.39285,"y":0.10752,"w":0.52527,"h":0.06736,"fs":0.01279,"n":4,"k":1,"t":"Implicit Differentiation 1. Differentiate both sides of the equation with respect to x, treating y as a dif- ferentiable function of x. 2. Collect the terms with dy>dx on one side of the equation and solve for dy>dx."},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.23824,"w":0.42267,"h":0.02323,"fs":0.01407,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"EXAMPLE 3 Find dy>dx if y2 = x2 + sinxy (Figure 3.31)."},{"x":0.22645,"y":0.26351,"w":0.08666,"h":0.01461,"fs":0.01023,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"y2 = x2 + sin xy"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.27468,"w":0.33525,"h":0.01365,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"Solution We differentiate the equation implicitly."},{"x":0.51204,"y":0.2934,"w":0.14429,"h":0.05118,"fs":0.01441,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"y2 = x2 + sinxy d dx1y22 = d"},{"x":0.58323,"y":0.30868,"w":0.08306,"h":0.0359,"fs":0.01441,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"dx1x22 + d"},{"x":0.6545,"y":0.30868,"w":0.07124,"h":0.0359,"fs":0.01441,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"dx1sin xy2"},{"x":0.78301,"y":0.31748,"w":0.15234,"h":0.02302,"fs":0.01023,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"Differentiate both sides with respect to x c"},{"x":0.09637,"y":0.34924,"w":0.19424,"h":0.01078,"fs":0.01023,"n":5,"k":0,"t":"0 2 4 −2 −4"},{"x":0.52575,"y":0.35104,"w":0.16231,"h":0.02973,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"2ydy dx = 2x + (cos xy) d"},{"x":0.78301,"y":0.35312,"w":0.15853,"h":0.02357,"fs":0.01023,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"ctreating y as a function of x and using the Chain Rule."},{"x":0.67627,"y":0.3607,"w":0.0449,"h":0.02009,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"dx (xy)"},{"x":0.17806,"y":0.37749,"w":0.01745,"h":0.01078,"fs":0.01023,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"−2"},{"x":0.52575,"y":0.38646,"w":0.21527,"h":0.0305,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"2ydy dx = 2x + (cos xy)ay + xdy"},{"x":0.72559,"y":0.38646,"w":0.16925,"h":0.0305,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"dxb Treat xy as a product."},{"x":0.17806,"y":0.41197,"w":0.01745,"h":0.01078,"fs":0.01023,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"−4"},{"x":0.4043,"y":0.42266,"w":0.14393,"h":0.0305,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"2ydy dx - (cos xy)axdy"},{"x":0.53281,"y":0.42266,"w":0.38631,"h":0.0305,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"dxb = 2x + (cos xy)y Collect terms with dy>dx."},{"x":0.08775,"y":0.44567,"w":0.25883,"h":0.02762,"fs":0.01151,"n":3,"k":1,"t":"FIGURE 3.31 The graph of the equation in Example 3."},{"x":0.4389,"y":0.45962,"w":0.11985,"h":0.02246,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"(2y - x cos xy)dy"},{"x":0.54332,"y":0.46861,"w":0.13123,"h":0.02074,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"dx = 2x + y cos xy"},{"x":0.54332,"y":0.49515,"w":0.13131,"h":0.0304,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"dy dx = 2x + y cos xy"},{"x":0.58323,"y":0.49904,"w":0.28733,"h":0.02644,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"2y - x cos xy Solve for dy>dx."},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.52574,"w":0.593,"h":0.05392,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":1,"t":"Notice that the formula for dy>dx applies everywhere that the implicitly defined curve has a slope. Notice again that the derivative involves both variables x and y, not just the inde- pendent variable x."},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.6036,"w":0.20658,"h":0.01375,"fs":0.01375,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Derivatives of Higher Order"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.62826,"w":0.43124,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Implicit differentiation can also be used to find higher derivatives."},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.65618,"w":0.33195,"h":0.02323,"fs":0.01407,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"EXAMPLE 4 Find d2y>dx2 if 2x3 - 3y2 = 8."},{"x":0.36259,"y":0.69263,"w":0.59302,"h":0.02899,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":1,"t":"Solution To start, we differentiate both sides of the equation with respect to x in order to find y′ = dy>dx."},{"x":0.46,"y":0.73141,"w":0.13773,"h":0.0276,"fs":0.01401,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"d dx (2x3 - 3y2) = d"},{"x":0.58594,"y":0.73863,"w":0.03862,"h":0.02008,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"dx (8)"},{"x":0.48774,"y":0.75905,"w":0.39253,"h":0.01795,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"6x2 - 6yy′ = 0 Treat y as a function of x."},{"x":0.54883,"y":0.78283,"w":0.05031,"h":0.02139,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"y′ = x2"},{"x":0.58892,"y":0.79076,"w":0.22463,"h":0.01765,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":1,"t":"y , when y ≠0 Solve for y′."},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.82146,"w":0.28406,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"We now apply the Quotient Rule to find y″."},{"x":0.58218,"y":0.84086,"w":0.11806,"h":0.02802,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"y b = 2xy - x2y′"},{"x":0.55104,"y":0.8415,"w":0.04136,"h":0.0305,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"dx ax2"},{"x":0.76471,"y":0.84294,"w":0.0368,"h":0.03067,"fs":0.01918,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"y2 # y′"},{"x":0.72884,"y":0.84332,"w":0.04902,"h":0.02557,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"y - x2"},{"x":0.51312,"y":0.84472,"w":0.04973,"h":0.01999,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"y″ = d"},{"x":0.65728,"y":0.84472,"w":0.08291,"h":0.02889,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"y2 = 2x"},{"x":0.3626,"y":0.87219,"w":0.43087,"h":0.02323,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"Finally, we substitute y′ = x2>y to express y″ in terms of x and y."},{"x":0.57201,"y":0.90199,"w":0.03911,"h":0.03211,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"y2 ax2"},{"x":0.60091,"y":0.90199,"w":0.06067,"h":0.02739,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"y b = 2x"},{"x":0.53615,"y":0.90381,"w":0.04902,"h":0.02557,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"y - x2"},{"x":0.65023,"y":0.90381,"w":0.04902,"h":0.02557,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"y - x4"},{"x":0.49414,"y":0.90521,"w":0.05336,"h":0.02001,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"y″ = 2x"},{"x":0.68609,"y":0.91175,"w":0.13439,"h":0.02227,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"y3, when y ≠0"}]}